python -m pip install opencv-python mediapipe
pip install cmake dlib face_recognition

For face_recognition you may need to download Visual C++ Build Tools from: https://visualstudio.microsoft.com/visual-cpp-build-tools/


#From : https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1lN4L74BwWo

Usage:

python VibeCheck.py -> No facial recognition enabled, full speed
python VibeCheck.py --face-recognition -> Enables facial recognition, but may run slowly. Don't use this if you run into a lot of lag.

Press 's' to toggle skeleton, 'q' to quit